---
// src/pages/en/metodologia.astro
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../../components/Breadcrumb.astro';

const titulo = "Testing Methodology & Editorial Criteria | ZenZone";
const descripcion = "Discover how we review and evaluate products at ZenZone: ergonomics criteria, durability, value for money, and affiliate transparency.";
---

<Layout title={titulo} description={descripcion}>
  
  <Breadcrumb items={[
    { label: 'Home', url: '/' },
    { label: 'Methodology' }
  ]} />

  <header class="text-center my-10 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-600 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
      🔬 Evaluation Process & Quality Standards
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 mb-4 tracking-tight">
      Review <span class="text-amber-500">Methodology</span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
      Transparently explaining how we test every product, the metrics we use, and how we guarantee honest, unbiased recommendations.
    </p>
  </header>

  <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none bg-white p-8 md:p-12 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-8 mb-16">
    
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">1. Product Selection Criteria</h2>
      <p>
        Before any item enters our comparison guides, it must pass our initial quality filter:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Verified Ratings & Reputation:</strong> We prioritize products with a minimum 4.3 out of 5 stars rating on Amazon supported by hundreds of authentic buyer reviews.</li>
        <li><strong>Ergonomics Grounded in Health Standards:</strong> We focus on gear featuring accredited ergonomic parameters (breathable mesh, 2D/3D lumbar adjustment, 57° vertical mouse angles, SGS certified pneumatic lifts).</li>
        <li><strong>Proven Value for Money:</strong> We review historical pricing to recommend items delivering genuine long-term value.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-slate-200 my-6" />

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">2. Evaluation Process</h2>
      <p>
        Products are weighted across 4 core dimensions:
      </p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Ergonomics & Postural Health (40%):</strong> Muscle strain reduction, proper support for key zones (lumbar spine, neck, wrist, and eye care).</li>
        <li><strong>Build Quality & Durability (30%):</strong> Frame materials, assembly sturdiness, and mesh/fabric resistance to daily wear.</li>
        <li><strong>Usability & Assembly (15%):</strong> Ease of setup, daily user experience, and manual clarity.</li>
        <li><strong>Innovation & Feature Set (15%):</strong> Standout capabilities (multi-device pairing, 45° asymmetric lighting, space-saving designs).</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <hr class="border-slate-200 my-6" />

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">3. Periodic Content Updates</h2>
      <p>
        The office equipment market evolves rapidly. We review our guides and top picks monthly to ensure price accuracy, product availability, and relevant recommendations for 2026.
      </p>
    </div>

  </article>

</Layout>
